<section class="page-intro"><a href="/" class="breadcrumb">Home / Our world</a><span class="eyebrow">FOI Boutique</span><h1>A world of details.<br/><em>Make it personal.</em></h1><p>A style for your story.</p></section><section class="fashion-story about-story"><div class="fashion-story-photo"><img src="@Shop.Settings.Story" alt="The collection of FOI Boutique" width="900" height="1200"/></div><div class="fashion-story-copy"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE ABOUT US</span><h2>Get to know<br/><em>the collection.</em></h2><p>Explore the collection at your own pace. Save the details you love and bring your sizing, colour and delivery questions to the team.</p><p>Build your own story through layers, colour and a considered silhouette. Explore FOI Boutique’s collection images, gather your favourites and ask the Beirut team about the details that make your selection personal.</p><a class="button" href="/shop">Explore the collection ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="@Shop.Settings.Instagram" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit our Instagram ↗</a></div></section><section class="section prose"><h2>Your own way to explore.</h2><p>Discover the photographed looks, keep a list of favourites and send a personal enquiry. Colours, sizing, availability and ordering details are confirmed directly with the team.</p><a class="text-link" href="/lookbook">Open the visual diary ↗</a></section>
